-- local.lua — your machine-specific additions. Copy this file to local.lua and edit.
-- hyprland.lua loads it last, so anything here overrides the defaults, and the installer
-- never overwrites it.

-- A fixed mode and scale for the laptop panel (rice-settings → display can also do this):
